# SHELVED 2026-10-02 (base-v1-0019): a sketch with no native. It declared tasks that bound nothing, so a call built clean and
# threw `stub` at run time; out of the build until it has bodies.


task list
  take
    limit
    like size
    fall 100
  like list

task search
  take pattern, like text
  take
    limit
    like size
    fall 10
  like list

task clear

task save
  note async
  take path, like text

task load
  note async
  take path, like text
  like list
